  "description": "For ten years, Seon-U has lived in complete isolation from society. By his side is Young-Shin, a perfect and devoted Olympic gold medalist. Within the secluded paradise Young-Shin has built, Seon-U’s frozen time seems eternal. However, when Do-Hyeon, a genius physicist and Seon-U’s former lover, returns, cracks begin to appear in this once-perfect world. A chilling intrusion that forces everything back onto its former course. Is he a steadfast savior, or the most bizarre tormentor? The moment the time that has been frozen for ten years shatters, the cruelest form of salvation and obsession collide.\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
